{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1603927,\"title\":\"Christmas with André Rieu - Live in Maastricht\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"André Rieu & His Johann Strauss Orchestra performing live in Maastricht (2019).\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vSuXF0oJejsd8PZSCvyFv1dWTnR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ocw5B50XzMR6GEY0TsOZmDpVrw1.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2025,\"runtime\":90,\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Family\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":931421,\"name\":\"André Rieu\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/toabyJ2w8pNf1xM0oJPWSawDpMB.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":54518,\"title\":\"Justin Bieber: Never Say Never\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dGNMD5XTBQN3teIth21ohKOCJcR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wsuO9N3t89buTgtzJ5vUMBCHBB6.jpg\",\"rating\":5.2,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Tells the story of Justin Bieber, the kid from Canada with the hair, the smile and the voice: It chronicles his unprecedented rise to fame, all the way from busking in the streets of Stratford, Canada to putting videos on YouTube to selling out Madison Square Garden in New York as the headline act during the My World Tour from 2010. It features Usher, Scooter Braun, Ludacris, Sean Kingston, Antonio \\\"L.A.\\\" Reid, Boyz II Men, Miley Cyrus, Jaden Smith, Justin's family members and parts of his crew and huge fanbase in a mix of interviews and guest performances.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Documentary\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1667,\"title\":\"March of the Penguins\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o9xJ1xG1WKlHkl8ACqq0LShOuMu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lPsKI7VR1FJY3w8iEOBZEhWAESc.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Every year, thousands of Antarctica's emperor penguins make an astonishing journey to breed their young. They walk, marching day and night in single file 70 miles into the darkest, driest and coldest continent on Earth.  This amazing, true-life tale is touched with humour and alive with thrills. Breathtaking photography captures the transcendent beauty and staggering drama of devoted parent penguins who, in the fierce polar winter, take turns guarding their egg and trekking to the ocean in search of food. Predators hunt them, storms lash them. But the safety of their adorable chicks makes it all worthwhile. So follow the leader... to adventure!!\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":62320,\"title\":\"Home\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2Ph0vzTiORSSlYjsXLFM1OZHkI8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1WKtWXw6yfi5yGknLSvmJLhLa0R.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 200,000 years of existence, man has upset the balance on which the Earth had lived for 4 billion years. Global warming, resource depletion, species extinction: man has endangered his own home. But it is too late to be pessimistic: humanity has barely ten years left to reverse the trend, become aware of its excessive exploitation of the Earth's riches, and change its consumption pattern.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":36970,\"title\":\"Oceans\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kIT3G7QoV1vatMCL8TAA3xnkO2V.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hZVk7Tc16mkfM3Y53ZQwMQIoolV.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An ecological drama/documentary, filmed throughout the globe. Part thriller, part meditation on the vanishing wonders of the sub-aquatic world.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Family\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":67675,\"title\":\"Glee: The Concert Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/y5NCu183zREb4XmHSB6QP3K7TH2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bCmzUxV0YxRv22l2CXBZCjP2H5E.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A concert documentary shot during the Glee Live! In Concert! summer 2011 tour, featuring song performances and fans' life stories and how the show influenced them.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Documentary\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":251471,\"title\":\"A LEGO Brickumentary\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ojBg3yJfsqzi1maypHV7sW7COcn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oAiqaBzPB3wsfvplA4PHpaNpB9n.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A look at the global culture and appeal of the LEGO building-block toys.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":665135,\"title\":\"Elephant\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wvRbUiOuqedyDmwToErkp7wuFCv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jqEaYZQTwvvq6CThrtXDTfVfk7m.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Disneynature’s Elephant follows African elephant Shani and her spirited son Jomo as their herd make an epic journey hundreds of miles across the vast Kalahari Desert. Led by their great matriarch, Gaia, the family faces brutal heat, dwindling resources and persistent predators, as they follow in their ancestors’ footsteps on a quest to reach a lush, green paradise.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Family\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":376530,\"title\":\"The Eagle Huntress\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x0dZQM1vmDmFrOa7JoRDOTdLb3Q.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m6Rk92lA11e4gCisMb6I8OsWQ9t.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Follow Aisholpan, a 13-year-old girl, as she trains to become the first female in twelve generations of her Kazakh family to become an eagle hunter, and rise to the pinnacle of a tradition that has been typically been handed down from father to son for centuries.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Documentary\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":324325,\"title\":\"Twinsters\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zU6hCAaOXj55xjJR6BeSZu3iWBo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1Bmx197oS7RELUYfgT2Alhroo1o.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Adopted from South Korea, raised on different continents &amp; connected through social media, Samantha &amp; Anaïs believe that they are twin sisters separated at birth.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":653748,\"title\":\"The Go-Go's\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c5bktp3aUDplX9xCPrPrKxwOnVY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2QDgTgyfjDzEsbhzXYeDyGDzqLf.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"As the first all-female band to play their instruments, write their songs and have a No. 1 album, The Go-Go’s made history. Underpinned by candid testimonies, this film chronicles the meteoric rise to fame of a band born in the LA punk scene who became a pop phenomenon.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1048418,\"title\":\"All I Want for Christmas: The Magic Time Machine\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w11j3YoRjRCivffVcSDoHst1mUu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/plT8sTOFzKdqx2fXNKTHCGbCxXe.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"At Santa Claus School, the principal has called a meeting. Lucia, her parents Julius and Claudia and everyone else at school are excited. But the tension is replaced by a shock when the headmaster cancels Christmas. He seems confused, and it soon becomes clear that he is trapped in a Christmas trauma from his younger days as Santa Claus. Lucia sets out to find out what has happened and with the help of the younger student Elias and a magical time machine, she travels back in time in the hope of saving Christmas.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9969,\"title\":\"Deck the Halls\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/smJDzhYGhl6j9OrucsB7IkMNy82.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lVSj3d2dvTaK3qO9K2aD1W4L7R0.jpg\",\"rating\":5.6,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Determined to unseat Steve Finch's reign as the town's holiday season king, Buddy Hall plasters his house with so many decorative lights that it'll be visible from space! When their wives bond, and their kids follow suit, the two men only escalate their rivalry - and their decorating.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"rC7IsX_muok\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"B_0cSLIVICs\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"RPSHEehvRF8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}